indeed a level, I have been there.  Well, I was level teleported to
thier, and it said something like:
You arrive in heaven -more-
"Its too early for you to be here" -more-
"But we'll take you anyway"

End of game.

So if you can level teleport there, why can't you go up the stairs in
each level.  Why should hell be only place you can travel.  If its like the 
cartoons, it would be an escalator.  It could be a ladder, guarded by a 
Priest named Jacob.

Anyways, just some random thoughts.  Would like to see it.
